m/7c17b57f-fb3c-45b4-a286-ec01d1ef6abf.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "标普500盈利增长日益依赖半导体，行业景气一旦逆转，可能对整个大盘形成拖累。\n\n\n据追风交易台，这种风险已体现在盈利预测中。半导体与科技硬件行业合计仅占标普500指数权重的29%，却贡献了2027财年约75%的EPS上修幅度，预计还将贡献当年约70%的指数EPS增长。\n\n\n盈利贡献高度集中，叠加半导体行业本身较大的预测", "published_at": "2026-10-12T08:30:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5b1295409a4b.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-640b3c35654e", "title": "尊界：11 月起陆续升级踏板；iPhone 折叠屏国内预约超 200 万；6 个月，超千万 Claude 账户被封杀｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/372218", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/13/82/1382624c8bdc73f0c9f848ff45d2bad9.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n陶哲轩提出「数学 2.0」：AI 解题之外，还要帮助人理解证明\n\n\n10 月 11 日，数学家陶哲轩公开了在加州理工学院的演讲《数学 2.0》。他认为，AI 正在降低部分数学问题的求解成本，使数学研究逐渐从「证明稀缺」走向「证明富足」。但目前多数前沿问题仍未解决，不能只凭公开传播的成功案例判断 AI", "published_at": "2026-10-12T00:02:38Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-640b3c35654e.json", "engagement": 210, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-72e628d0d42b", "title": "一周 10 万星，AI「逆向一切」，但大家不要过于兴奋", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "极客公园", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783415", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/fcccc6b0-7e61-44c5-a580-4855d39a8d32.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "「在应用里看到一个想加入自己产品的功能？让智能体去帮你调查它。」\n\n\n这是 REA 项目主页第一屏的话。后半句更直接：即使没有源代码，智能体也可以检查应用、解释功能怎么工作、展示证据，「并为你的项目实现类似功能」。\n\n\nREA 全名 Reverse Engineer Anything，即「逆向一切」。上周它在 AI", "published_at": "2026-10-12T07:54:20Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-72e628d0d42b.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-75f6f558d44b", "title": "The developer of an AI-powered driving instruction simulator is spending $1,000 per month just to keep its demo running", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "Rick Lane", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/games/sim/the-developer-of-an-ai-powered-driving-instruction-simulator-is-spending-usd1-000-per-month-just-to-keep-its-demo-running/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/mpQFst9ntNsDXtxsubpvs-1920-80.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nOne of the many ways AI will (supposedly) revolutionise the games industry in facilitating highly reactive NPCs via LLM-powered chatbots. Yet so far, only a", "published_at": "2026-10-11T12:31:04Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-75f6f558d44b.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ac7e2f85cd76", "title": "Steam Week in Review: The curious case of Wonder Boy in Monster Land's dubious PC debut", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "shaun.prescott@futurenet.com (Shaun Prescott)", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/gaming-industry/steam-week-in-review-the-curious-case-of-wonder-boy-in-monster-lands-dubious-pc-debut/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/qWagYHzSXRvDqGfNjL4Ju5-1920-80.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "\nWonder Boy in Monster Land released in Japanese arcades in 1987 and for the Sega Master System the following year. Its success led to numerous ports,", "published_at": "2026-10-12T02:57:30Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ac7e2f85cd76.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f9c017bca336", "title": "国投林荣雄：A股科技年内第二波行情可期，10月下旬是关键窗口", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783436", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cc33e58c-7b07-483e-bbdc-cf6986399a8a.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "A股大盘再度回落至年内低位，但国投证券首席策略分析师林荣雄认为，转机或已临近。\n\n\n在10月11日最新发布的策略周报中，林荣雄团队提出，10月下旬美股AI龙头三季报及资本开支指引的集中披露，叠加国内A股三季报窗口与DeepSeek筹备科创板上市，将构成AI产业景气的重要验证期。若届时长端美债利率随财政预期降温而回落，A", "published_at": "2026-10-12T09:05:11Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f9c017bca336.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-2bd84fbf7340", "title": "A Viral London Chef Has Opened His Buzzy Soho Restaurant", "source": "Eater NY", "author": "", "url": "https://ny.eater.com/news/414244/strakers-thomas-straker-soho-nyc-opening", "image_url": "https://platform.ny.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/ClaudiaMartel_Strakers_4935.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,0,100,100", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "food", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Eater NY", "Lifestyle", "en", "food", "text", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "A spread from Straker’s. | Claudia Martel\n\nThomas Straker, the London-based celebrity chef with more than two million followers on both Instagram and TikTok,", "published_at": "2026-10-11T10:10:16Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-2bd84fbf7340.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-65e9bceb19ba", "title": "ICYMI: An Indian Restaurant Favorite Is Headed to Williamsburg", "source": "Eater NY", "author": "", "url": "https://ny.eater.com/news/414154/nyc-restaurant-news-october-2026", "image_url": "https://platform.ny.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/jackfruit.webp?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,0,100,100", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "food", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Eater NY", "Lifestyle", "en", "food", "text", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "Gupshup brings its jackfruit tacos to Williamsburg this summer. | ﻿Gupshup\n\nWe’ve been covering various NYC restaurants, food, drinks, bars, etc. news intel", "published_at": "2026-10-11T10:10:16Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-65e9bceb19ba.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-794ecb3524b0", "title": "全球经济的“风暴眼”：发达国家“债务危机”", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783373", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/afb4bf8a-7068-4d9e-9d3f-8c992eac51ee.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "发达国家正从全球金融体系的稳定锚，转变为新的风险源。在能源价格飙升、利率持续走高的背景下，美国、欧洲和日本的债务可持续性问题日益突出。曾被视为全球金融市场安全底座的发达经济体，如今自身的财政状况正成为投资者无法忽视的隐忧。\n\n\n国际货币基金组织（IMF）总裁Kristalina", "published_at": "2026-10-11T09:15:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-794ecb3524b0.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-8993ec8b1c56", "title": "韩国散户三季度“脱韩入美”：抛售韩股逾5.5万亿韩元，买入美股超10万亿韩元", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783362", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/881bf872-1bb7-46b6-b